{"version":1,"content":"<p>天王郭富城（城城）與張智霖（Chilam）相識數十年，是圈中公認的好兄弟。</p><p>近日有網民翻出城城2010年在社交網發布的陳年舊帖，發現他當年居然公然叫好兄弟做「弱智」，搞笑互動在社交平台迅速瘋傳，震撼新一代網民！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:23:41.222559+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T09:01:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:19:46.241744+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:19:46.241744+00:00","content_hash":"2d77cc80af14b0d163e2b7120de196c9f54965ee673910a7aa14f3ae577390c4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}